# The analysis run records the SHA-256 checksum of pdxe_utils.py and of each
# plan in prespecification/ in outputs/manifest.json, and the figures notebook
# refuses to run if pdxe_utils.py no longer matches. Marking these files -text
# stops git from converting their line endings on commit or checkout (for
# example on Windows with core.autocrlf), so the copies in this repository
# keep exactly the bytes that were checksummed.
pdxe_utils.py            -text
prespecification/*.json  -text
